    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1. Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process. In this context, the local authority wishes to study and deploy an artificial intelligence solution allowing to assist the agents in the agents daily missions, notably to facilitate the access to the information, improve the quality of the answers and reduce the times of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10. Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1. Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process. In this context, the local authority wishes to study and deploy an artificial intelligence solution allowing to assist the agents in the agents daily missions, notably to facilitate the access to the information, improve the quality of the answers and reduce the times of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The present contract has for object the design, the implementation and the deployment of such a solution. 2. General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process. The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories). The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files. The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4. Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR). To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance. No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5. Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests. A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services. An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6. Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data. To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years. The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority. The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information. The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9. Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The present contract has for object the design, the implementation and the deployment of such a solution. 2. General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process. The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10. Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk21> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the City of Belval's objectives to improve administrative services' efficiency and quality, and considering the need for an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents daily tasks, how can we consolidate we consortium's expertise to provide a coherent tender response that addresses the client's high-level business needs and goals?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk22> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To consolidate our consortium's expertise and provide a coherent tender response, I would leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s experience in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk23> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s has led 8 consortia in the past and has partner management experience, which will be beneficial in this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk24> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s can combine Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s expertise with that of Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s known partners, such as LexIA GmbH, who specialize in Legal AI and regulatory compliance engines, to provide an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents daily tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk25> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, EuroCloud Solutions S.A.'s expertise in sovereign cloud hosting and SecNumCloud infrastructure can ensure the security and scalability of the proposed solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk26> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s past references, such as the digital workplace transformation for Comune di Torino and the AI-powered document management system for Regione Lombardia, demonstrate Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s ability to deliver similar projects successfully." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk27> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s can draw on this experience to address the City of Belval's objectives and provide a tailored solution that meets the City of Belval's high-level business needs and goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk28> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By emphasizing Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s project management capabilities, including Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe methodologies, as well as Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s certifications, such as PMP and ITIL v4, Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s can demonstrate Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s ability to manage complex projects and ensure successful delivery." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk29> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s risk management approach, which includes maintaining a risk register and reviewing risks bi-weekly, will also provide assurance that Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s can identify and mitigate potential risks effectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk3> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories). The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files. The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk30> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by combining Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s expertise with that of Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s partners and highlighting Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s past successes and project management capabilities, Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s can submit a strong tender response that addresses the City of Belval's objectives." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk31> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval requires a solution with response times < 2 seconds, 99.9% availability, API integration with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk32> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, with no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk33> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technology stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose? our technical expertise includes API integration, Cloud architecture, and cybersecurity, which aligns with The City of Belval requirements. our have experience with SecNumCloud deployments and can host the solution on certified infrastructure within the EU using providers like Outscale or OVHcloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk34> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the response time requirement of < 2 seconds, our can leverage our expertise in RAG frameworks such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, or Haystack, and inference servers like vLLM or Ollama. our typical performance benchmarks show a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which is close to the required threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk35> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For API integration, our have experience with various standards like REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as API gateways like Kong or Apigee. our can integrate with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM systems like Alfresco or Maarch Courrier, and user directories using protocols like SAML 2.0 or OpenID Connect." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk36> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve 99.9% availability, our can design a highly available architecture using containerization with Docker and Kubernetes, and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana. our past projects have achieved an average availability of 99.92%, which is close to the required threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk37> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the constraints, I propose an architecture that utilizes our existing technology stack, including RAG frameworks, inference servers, API gateways, and containerization. our will deploy the solution on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, ensuring no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk38> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should be aware of the potential overhead cost of 15% associated with SecNumCloud deployments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk39> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, including hosting data exclusively within the EU, no data transfer outside the EU, and protection of sensitive data through encryption or anonymization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk4> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4. Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR). To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk40> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we security measures align with these requirements, and what AI security controls should we implement to guarantee explicability and transparency? we have a strong GDPR posture in place, with standard data residency set to the EU and cross-border transfer policy prohibited by default unless an explicit legal basis is provided. we utilize anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models to protect sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk41> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure alignment with these requirements, we can implement we data subject rights, including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection, and conduct Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) as needed, which typically take around 3 weeks to complete." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk42> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI security controls, we can implement measures such as prompt injection protection, output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, confidence threshold escalation, and model isolation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk43> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, we inference API only allows indirect model access for end users, and we conduct security reviews for all model updates. measures such as prompt injection protection, output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, confidence threshold escalation, and model isolation will help ensure explicability, transparency, and GDPR compliance in we AI-powered systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk44> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval demands compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and expects explicability of recommendations or proposals issued by the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk45> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the necessary regulations, such as data protection and AI decision-making? we should flag typical legal risks such as open-source licence compliance, cross-border data flow, AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk46> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, we standard legal basis is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest. we have a DPA template version 3.2 available and provide DPIA support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk47> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since we operate intra-EU only, no Standard Contractual Clauses or adequacy decisions are required." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk48> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI decision-making, we have expertise in AI Act and are aware of prohibited AI practices. we also enforce human oversight contractually and have a policy of not making automated decisions without human validation. we solutions provide explicability of recommendations or proposals, which aligns with The City of Belval demands for transparency and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance. No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5. Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, I do not have information about a specific project with a global budget allocated of 3 million euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The active projects listed in the provided context have different budgets and details." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, using our pricing model and target gross margin percentage of 28, if our were to consider a hypothetical project with a budget of 3 million euros, our projected margin would be 840,000 euros, calculated as 28% of 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, according to our cost sensitivity information, our could potentially absorb a 10% budget reduction via rate renegotiation with subcontractors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For larger reductions, scope reduction or removal of optional modules might be necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval seeks a solution that provides intelligent assistance to agents, including search for information, help with drafting letters or answers, and suggestion of actions or steps in administrative processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we design to meet these requirements, and how can we ensure we solution is explainable and transparent?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The City of Belval needs, we can leverage we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A suitable approach would involve deploying a sovereign model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and is self-hostable.  we can fine-tune a sovereign model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and is self-hostable using we preferred methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to adapt a sovereign model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong performance in French-language tasks and is self-hostable to the administrative tone and format required by The City of Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests. A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services. An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we will utilize RAG capabilities with semantic chunking and hybrid retrieval strategies to provide accurate information search and suggestion of actions within administrative processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability and transparency, we can implement source citation through RAG grounding, display chain-of-thought, and use SHAP for classification models when necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Confidence scoring will also be integrated, with a low confidence threshold set at 0.65, triggering an uncertainty warning and escalation to human supervisors when needed. we innovation strategy involves ongoing research into knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, which can further enhance the solution's capabilities in the future." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quarterly bias testing on demographically diverse test sets will ensure compliance with EU AI Act limited risk requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these components and strategies, we can develop an intelligent assistance system that effectively supports agents of The City of Belval while maintaining high standards of explainability, transparency, and compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to reduce The City of Belval environmental footprint and energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our proposed solution contribute to aims, and what measures can we take to rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can contribute to aims through Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have partnered with green hosting providers, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy. green hosting providers, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) is also relatively low, at 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging green hosting providers, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can help reduce the carbon footprint associated with data hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6. Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data. To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices can lead to an estimated 35% reduction in energy consumption compared to baseline levels. our digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy that ensures equipment has a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact, our can recommend The City of Belval consider subscribing to renewable energy Guarantee of Origin certificates for any on-premise servers. subscribing would help ensure that the electricity used by any on-premise servers comes from renewable sources, aligning with any on-premise servers goal of reducing environmental footprint and energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# Executive Summary The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A., proposes a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in the City of Belval's municipal agents daily tasks. proposes leverages large language models (LLMs), retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, and expertise in GDPR compliance, AI security controls, and sovereign cloud hosting to provide an efficient and secure assistance tool. With a strong focus on innovation, sustainability, and regulatory adherence, The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. aim to enhance the quality of service rendered to users while reducing processing times. # Understanding of Requirements the City of Belval's seeks to implement an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in accessing information, drafting administrative contents, instructing files, and suggesting actions or steps within administrative processes. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in accessing information, drafting administrative contents, instructing files, and suggesting actions or steps within administrative processes must integrate with existing systems, ensure data protection and GDPR compliance, provide explicability and transparency, and meet specific performance and availability requirements. # Proposed Solution an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in accessing information, drafting administrative contents, instructing files, and suggesting actions or steps within administrative processes involves deploying a sovereign LLM like Mistral 7B Instruct, fine-tuned using LoRA or QLoRA methods to adapt to the administrative tone and format required by the City of Belval's." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. will utilize RAG capabilities with semantic chunking and hybrid retrieval strategies for accurate information search and suggestion of actions within administrative processes. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in accessing information, drafting administrative contents, instructing files, and suggesting actions or steps within administrative processes will be hosted on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, using providers like Outscale or OVHcloud, ensuring no dependency on non-European suppliers. For API integration, The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. will use standards like REST, GraphQL, or SOAP, and API gateways like Kong or Apigee to integrate with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM systems like Alfresco or Maarch Courrier, and user directories using protocols like SAML 2.0 or OpenID Connect." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve 99.9% availability, The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. will design a highly available architecture using containerization with Docker and Kubernetes, and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in accessing information, drafting administrative contents, instructing files, and suggesting actions or steps within administrative processes will ensure GDPR compliance through strict data residency set to EU only, cross-border transfer policy prohibited by default, and utilization of anonymisation tools like Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models. AI security controls will include prompt injection protection, output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, confidence threshold escalation, and model isolation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. project a margin of 840,000 euros based on a hypothetical project budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, using The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. standard pricing model and target gross margin percentage of 28. For cost optimization, The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. can absorb a 10% budget reduction via rate renegotiation with subcontractors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce the environmental footprint, The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. will leverage green hosting providers OVHcloud and Scaleway, who use 100% renewable energy and have a low Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively. The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can lead to an estimated 35% reduction in energy consumption. # Unaddressed Requirements None of the requirements from the tender are left unaddressed by proposes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. note that the Budget Agent did not have specific information about a project with a global budget allocated of 3 million euros over 4 years but provided hypothetical calculations based on standard pricing models. # Conclusion Our consortium offers a comprehensive and innovative solution that addresses the City of Belval's needs for an artificial intelligence assistance tool. With a strong focus on regulatory compliance, security, sustainability, and performance, The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. are confident that proposes meets all the requirements outlined in the tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. look forward to the opportunity to discuss proposes in further detail and explore how The consortium led by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in collaboration with LexIA GmbH and EuroCloud Solutions S.A. can assist the City of Belval's in achieving the City of Belval's digital transformation objectives." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years. The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority. The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information. The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9. Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

